o cacciatore di demoni, sotto le mentite spoglie di un detective ha il compito di rintracciarli per volere del Re dei Demoni…"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Knight of Shadows: Between Yin and Yang","overview":"Pu Songling, a legendary demon hunter, is asked to investigate the mysterious disappearances of young girls from a small village. When he discovers evil forces are kidnapping the girls to feast on their souls, he sets out to save humanity from the inhuman invasion journeying through hidden worlds and colorful dimensions."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"神探蒲松龄","overview":"隐居深山老林的蒲松龄（成龙 饰）不仅是一名文采飞扬的文学家，更是一个身怀绝技的捉妖高手。在某次珠宝盗窃案中，蒲松龄和金华县菜鸟捕快严飞（林柏宏 饰）结识。在此之后，被衙门踢出来的严飞找上山来，死乞白赖要拜蒲松龄为师。适值此时，金华县初县令（潘长江 饰）的独女（姜嫄 饰）被女妖聂小倩（钟楚曦 饰）摄走，中途虽有法师宁采臣（阮经天 饰）阻拦，但是小姐却下落不明。得知此讯，蒲松龄带着严飞和“猪狮虎”（贾海涛 饰）、“屁屁”、“忘忧”、“千手”（朱剑锋 饰）等一众早已收伏的小妖下山捉妖，结果遭遇小倩的姐姐镜妖（林鹏 饰）阻挠。\r 　　一番混战过后，虽然镜妖被除，但是宁采臣和聂小倩之间仍有一段宿缘未了……"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ipXEk12zm5XLJtGMZpTMzkSk7jl.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nkLt5EEHWDTMbmUX5rj4fMcvI0I.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":512901,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x2n0On0tEvlPiXVqajPYbPYJtn0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x2n0On0tEvlPiXVqajPYbPYJtn0.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x2n0On0tEvlPiXVqajPYbPYJtn0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x2n0On0tEvlPiXVqajPYbPYJtn0.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eKB9IDeSdyvHWb4iwve7mgyvZmb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eKB9IDeSdyvHWb4iwve7mgyvZmb.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height